@page
@model StayWidget.Web.Pages.DemoModel
@{ViewData["Title"]="Try a synthetic reservation request"; ViewData["Description"]="Explore StayWidget's pending request and owner confirmation flow without an account or changes to real inventory.";}
<h1>Try the request flow</h1><p>This is a synthetic demonstration. Nothing is saved, no real accommodation is offered, and no guest information is collected. No email or payment is sent.</p>
<section class="card"><h2>Live embedded widget</h2><p>This uses the actual JavaScript loader and isolated, resizing iframe. Try dates and a request inside it. The demo collects no contact details and never writes to real inventory.</p><div data-staywidget="demo"><a href="/demo-widget" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open synthetic demo</a></div></section>
<details class="card"><summary>See the snippet used above</summary><p>This demo identifier works only on StayWidget's own origin. For your website, the owner installation screen generates a property UUID and approved website origins.</p><label for="demo-snippet">Demo embed snippet</label><textarea id="demo-snippet" class="install-snippet" readonly>@Model.Snippet</textarea><button type="button" data-copy-snippet="demo-snippet">Copy demo snippet</button><p id="snippet-result" role="status"></p></details>
<section class="card"><h2>Owner decision walkthrough</h2><p>Garden Cottage · two guests. Sample dates: June 10 → June 12. Two occupied nights; departure excluded.</p>
@if(Model.Stage=="Search"){<p>Available in this demonstration. Availability does not hold dates.</p><form method="post" asp-page-handler="Request"><button>Simulate reservation request</button></form>}
else if(Model.Stage=="Pending"){<h3>Request received — Pending</h3><p>This is not a confirmed reservation. In the actual product the guest saves a private link and the owner checks the dashboard, agrees price/terms and decides.</p><form method="post" asp-page-handler="Confirm"><button>Simulate owner confirmation</button></form>}
else{<h3>Confirmed — sample dates unavailable</h3><p>Confirmation creates occupancy after the database rechecks inventory. A conflicting confirmation is rejected. Outside bookings still have to be recorded manually.</p><a href="/Demo">Reset demonstration</a>}
</section><a class="button secondary" href="/Owner">Set up your property</a>
@section Scripts{<script src="/embed/v1/loader.js" defer></script><script src="/installation.js" defer></script>}
